For the init upload response, I'll set the URL to `${origin}/documents/${documentId}/upload`. Although the contract mentions the URL as a signed one, we can still create a route handler that accepts signature headers and writes the storage key from the database, ensuring security. This adjustment would align better with the acceptance criteria since it doesn’t specify the path for the upload endpoint.
