+# Run Summary: 20260208-002520-10946 (iter 2)
+
+Story: US-002 (Upload PDFs and observe ingest status)
+
+## Outcome
+- Implemented upload init, signed upload target, upload completion, and ingest status APIs.
+- Implemented a local filesystem object store + signed header auth for uploads (avoids signatures in logged URLs).
+- Implemented an in-process ingest worker (pdf.js) that populates `page_count`, `document_pages`, `chunks`, and `extraction_quality`.
+- Folder state is derived and persisted (`empty|ingesting|indexed|ready|failed`).
+
+## Verification
+- `ORBITAL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001 node --experimental-strip-types scripts/us002_smoke.ts` -> PASS
+- `pnpm typecheck` -> PASS
+- `pnpm verify` -> PASS
+
+## Commit
+- `f41655b feat(documents): upload PDFs and track ingest`
+
+## Notes
+- pdf.js in Next server bundles needs `GlobalWorkerOptions.workerSrc` set to a package specifier; otherwise fake worker setup fails.
+- Use `sql.json(...)` for `jsonb` values and cast `TransactionSql` to a callable tagged template for postgres.js typing.
+
